        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PR_000000006"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A TGF-beta superfamily receptor type-1 that is a translation product of the human BMPR1B gene or a 1:1 ortholog thereof. Bone morphogenetic protein (BMP) signals are transmitted by type 2 and type 1 serine/threonine kinase receptors. Type 2 receptors phosphorylate and activate type 1 receptors which autophosphorylate, then bind and activate SMAD transcriptional regulators. Receptor for BMPS/OP-1.</obo:IAO_0000115>
