        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A 5-hydroxytryptamine receptor that is a translation product of the human HTR7 gene or a 1:1 ortholog thereof. The preferred ligand is 5-hydroxytryptamine (serotonin).</obo:IAO_0000115>
