        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A rhodopsin-like G-protein coupled receptor that in active form binds to one or more chemokines.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Category=family. Note: Only those that have been unequivocally shown to activate a G-protein coupled signaling pathway appear on the official IUPHAR list.</rdfs:comment>
