        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A lysophospholipid (S1P) receptor that is a translation product of the human S1PR1 gene or a 1:1 ortholog thereof. The receptor is specifically expressed in endothelial cells, and to a lesser extent, in vascular smooth muscle cells, fibroblasts, melanocytes, and cells of epithelioid origin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CD363</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
