        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A lysophospholipid (S1P) receptor that is a translation product of the human S1PR5 gene or a 1:1 ortholog thereof. Although widely expressed in the brain, most prominently in the corpus callosum, it is detected at a low level in most tissues.</obo:IAO_0000115>
