        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An inwardly rectifying potassium channel protein that has core architecture consisting of an Inward rectifier potassium channel domain (Pfam:PF01007), which may be preceeded by an Inward rectifier potassium channel N-terminal domain (Pfam:PF08466).</obo:IAO_0000115>
