        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A protein that is a translation product of the human BCL2, BCL2L1, or BCL2L2 genes, 1:1 orthologs thereof, or a semi-ortholog thereof. The core domain architecture consists of an amino-terminal BH4 domain (Pfam:PF02180), which confers apoptosis inhibitory activity, and a Bcl-2 domain (Pfam:PF02180) common to many apoptosis regulator proteins.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Category=family.</rdfs:comment>
