        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An ion channel protein that has voltage-gated ion channel activity. A voltage-gated ion channel enables the transmembrane transfer of a solute by a channel whose open state is dependent on the voltage across the membrane in which it is embedded.</obo:IAO_0000115>
