        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An ion channel protein that has chloride channel activity. A chloride channel enables the facilitated diffusion of a chloride (by an energy-independent process) involving passage through a transmembrane aqueous pore or channel without evidence for a carrier-mediated mechanism.</obo:IAO_0000115>
