        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A protein that is a member of the phorbol ester (and diacylglycerol) receptor/protein kinase class. The canonical protein sequence has a core domain architecture consisting of a copy of the PB1 domain (Pfam:PF:00564), a Phorbol esters/diacylglycerol binding domain (C1 domain) (Pfam:PF00130), a Protein kinase domain (Pfam:PF00069) and a Protein kinase C terminal domain (Pfam:PF00433).</obo:IAO_0000115>
